<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Passive Yield Lab and its founder, Johnny Liu — practical guides on every way to build passive income, written by someone with real skin in the game." ogImage="/og/default.svg">
  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>About Passive Yield Lab</h1>

    <h2>Hi, I'm Johnny.</h2>

    <p>
      I'm Johnny Liu, the founder and editor of Passive Yield Lab. I started this
      site in 2026 after spending years building passive income streams across
      crypto, DeFi, AI tools, and digital products — often making expensive
      mistakes that nobody warned me about.
    </p>

    <p>
      My background is in software engineering. I currently run a small portfolio
      of crypto positions (staking, lending, liquid staking, DeFi) and a handful
      of automated AI businesses. Everything published here comes from real
      capital I've personally deployed and tools I've personally used.
    </p>

    <h2>Why This Site Exists</h2>

    <p>
      Most "passive income" content online is either hype, paid placement, or
      recycled from a single Twitter thread. I got tired of it. Passive Yield Lab
      is my attempt to publish the kind of guide I wish existed when I started:
      honest numbers, real risks, and platform comparisons written by someone who
      actually has skin in the game.
    </p>

    <h2>What I Cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Crypto Yield</strong> — I cover staking, liquid staking, DeFi pools, lending, and exchange earn programs</li>
      <li><strong>AI Income</strong> — I publish practical playbooks for building income with AI tools and automation</li>
      <li><strong>Investing</strong> — I write about dividend stocks, ETFs, REITs, P2P lending, and other yield-generating assets</li>
      <li><strong>Digital Products</strong> — I explore print-on-demand, online courses, templates, and other scalable income streams</li>
      <li><strong>Real Estate</strong> — I cover rental income strategies, Airbnb, and real estate crowdfunding</li>
      <li><strong>DeFi</strong> — I dig into liquidity pools, yield aggregators, and risk assessment</li>
      <li><strong>Tools &amp; Security</strong> — I review hardware wallets, tax software, and portfolio tracking tools</li>
      <li><strong>Automation</strong> — I document systems and workflows that earn while you sleep</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Editorial Principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>I only write about strategies I've personally used.</li>
      <li>Every affiliate relationship is disclosed at the top of the article and in the site-wide disclaimer.</li>
      <li>I never give financial advice — this is educational content only.</li>
      <li>I prioritize security and risk awareness in every guide.</li>
      <li>Articles are updated when key facts change (APYs, regulations, product features).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you sign up through them,
      I earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This helps me keep the
      site running and producing free content. I never let affiliate
      relationships influence my recommendations.
    </p>

